⏺ Deep in. What changed:

  - Tempo dropped to 85 BPM — ritual pace
  - Drums almost gone — just ghost pulses
  - Prometheus pad [D, F#, B] → [G#, C, E] — Scriabin's mystic chord voicings floating between each other
  - Iwato cluster [D, D#, G] droning underneath — unresolved forever
  - Sub pulse D1 → G# — tritone again, the tension never releases
  - Wind texture breathing under everything
  - Shimmer overtones drifting at 23-second sine pan cycle

  It won't land anywhere. That's the point. Want to push even deeper or bring something back in?
